That is her ransom; I deliver her;
And those two counties I will undertake
Your grace shall well and quietly enjoy.

To the water side I must conduct your grace;
Then give my charge up to Sir Nicholas Vaux,
Who undertakes you to your end.

Crowes will not feed their yong til 9. daies old,
Because their vnkind colour makes them doubt
Them to be theirs;

There be […] lords that can prate
As amply and unnecessarily
As this Gonzalo;

My ſcoles are not for unthriftes untaught,
For frantick faitours half mad and half ſtraught;
But my learning is of another degree
